                "watermarked_asset_pointer": null,
                "is_no_auth_placeholder": null
              }
            },
            "这个图怎么理解？我只知道一元语法 (Unigram)：\n\n- \r\n意思：假设序列中的每个词都是相互独立的\r\n。\n\n- \r\n公式：P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n )=P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n )\r\n。\n\n\r\n二元语法 (Bigram)：\n\n- \r\n意思：假设序列满足一阶马尔可夫性质，即当前词只取决于前一个词\r\n。\n\n- \r\n公式：P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n )=P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n )\r\n。\n\n\r\n三元语法 (Trigram)：\n\n- \r\n意思：假设当前词取决于前面两个词\r\n。\n- 公式：P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n )=P(x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n3\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n1\r\n​\r\n ,x \r\n2\r\n​\r\n )P(x \r\n4\r\n​\r\n ∣x \r\n2,3\r\n​\r\n )\r\n。"
          ]
        },
